---
title: Keyword cipher
tags: tools
---
{% from "macros/tool.njk" import toolSection with context %}
{% from "macros/tool-frame.njk" import toolFrame %}
{% set filename = page.fileSlug %}
{% set intro %}
<p class="px-2">
    The keyword, with any repeated letters removed, starts a new alphabet, and the rest of the letters follow in order. Each letter of the message is swapped for the letter in the same place in that alphabet. For example:
    <code class="d-inline-flex px-2 bg-success bg-opacity-10 border border-success border-opacity-10 rounded-2">Hello World</code> encrypted with a key of <code class="d-inline-flex px-2 bg-success bg-opacity-10 border border-success border-opacity-10 rounded-2">Test</code> uses the alphabet
    <code class="d-inline-flex px-2 bg-success bg-opacity-10 border border-success border-opacity-10 rounded-2">TESABCDFGH…</code> and becomes
    <code class="d-inline-flex px-2 bg-success bg-opacity-10 border border-success border-opacity-10 rounded-2">Fbjjm Wmpja</code>
</p>
{% endset %}
{% call toolSection(intro) %}
{% call toolFrame(filename, "Keyword cipher", placeholder = "Example: Hello World &srarr; Test [key] &srarr; Fbjjm Wmpja") %}
<div class="input-group w-auto">
    <label class="input-group-text" for="{{ filename }}Key"><span class="visually-hidden">Keyword </span>Key</label>
    <input type="text" class="form-control" id="{{ filename }}Key" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="{{ filename }}Status">
    <button class="btn btn-convrtr" type="button" id="{{ filename }}Encrypt" aria-pressed="true">Encrypt</button>
    <button class="btn btn-outline-convrtr" type="button" id="{{ filename }}Decrypt" aria-pressed="false">Decrypt</button>
</div>
{% endcall %}
{% endcall %}
